
<%args>

</%args>

<form id="converter_form" action="/tools/bulk/download" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">

<br />
<table summary="" cellpadding="10" width="100%"><tr><td valign="top" bgcolor="#EEEEEE" width="320">

<br />
輸入識別碼列表（SGN 單一基因群 ID 或 TOM1 微陣列 ID），或上傳以空格/換行/製表符分隔的識別碼檔案(Enter a list of identifiers or upload a file containing identifiers separated by whitespace)：<br />

<table summary="" width="100%" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>
<textarea name="ids" rows="5" cols="20"></textarea>
</td>
<td>
<i>範例(Example)：</i>
<pre style="border: 1px solid gray; width: 10em; height: 5em">
SGN-U562661
SGN-U562662
SGN-U562663
</pre>
</td></tr></table>
<br />
<br />

及/或上傳識別碼列表檔案(And/or upload list file)：<br /><input type="file" name="file" />
<br />
<br />

</td><td valign="top" bgcolor="#EEEEEE" width="320">

      <input type="hidden" name="idType" value="converter" />

      <input type="radio" name="converter_type" value="unigene_solyc_converter" checked="1" /> 將單一基因群 ID 轉換為番茄基因組 ID(Convert unigene ids to tomato genome ids)<br />
      <input type="radio" name="converter_type" value="unigene_version_converter" /> 轉換至最新版本(Convert to newest version)<br />

<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
</td></tr></table>
	<input type="reset" value="重設(Reset)" />&nbsp;&nbsp;
<input type="submit" value="送出(Submit)" /><br />


</form>
